  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659778",
      "title": "Conditional Content & A Suboptimal Way Of Updating State",
      "sourceHash": "54f6d9b10da2effbfc1cf91f3100f6eecb542badcb1503b47732ba1713f08e9a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 3.42,
          "en": "So now that we can show this input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.42,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "when we click edit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 9.06,
          "en": "the next goal is to populate this input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.06,
          "end": 10.89,
          "en": "with the current player name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.89,
          "end": 13.23,
          "en": "and to get rid of that input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.23,
          "end": 17.25,
          "en": "and show the player name again once we click edit again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.25,
          "end": 20.37,
          "en": "And this edit button also should say save",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.37,
          "end": 22.053,
          "en": "if we're currently editing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.01,
          "end": 26.01,
          "en": "So a couple of changes that should be made to the code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.01,
          "end": 29.22,
          "en": "and we can start with this button caption.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.22,
          "end": 33.3,
          "en": "To get this button to either say edit or save,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.3,
          "end": 36.36,
          "en": "depending on whether we are editing or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.36,
          "end": 39.36,
          "en": "we must replace this hard coded value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.36,
          "end": 40.74,
          "en": "with a dynamic value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.74,
          "end": 44.49,
          "en": "with help of these opening and closing curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.49,
          "end": 46.08,
          "en": "And then, in here, we, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.08,
          "end": 49.17,
          "en": "also wanna output some conditional content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.17,
          "end": 52.68,
          "en": "either the word edit or the word save,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.68,
          "end": 55.95,
          "en": "depending on the isEditing state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.95,
          "end": 59.295,
          "en": "Therefore, we could again create a variable here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.295,
          "end": 64.26,
          "en": "btnCaption, where we maybe say edit as a default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.26,
          "end": 69.063,
          "en": "and which we change to save if we are editing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.9,
          "end": 73.23,
          "en": "And then we could use this btnCaption here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.23,
          "end": 76.28999999999999,
          "en": "or we create ternary expression down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.28999999999999,
          "end": 79.41,
          "en": "where we check isEditing, and if it's truthy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.41,
          "end": 83.16,
          "en": "so if it's true, we say save because if we are editing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.16,
          "end": 86.73,
          "en": "the button should say save to save the changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.73,
          "end": 90.003,
          "en": "And otherwise, if we are not editing, we say edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.93,
          "end": 92.58,
          "en": "Both approaches work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.58,
          "end": 94.08,
          "en": "and to show you both,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.08,
          "end": 96.393,
          "en": "I'll go for the ternary expression here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.86,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "So with that, if we save this, this button says save,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 104.88300000000001,
          "en": "and otherwise it says edit if we aren't editing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.75,
          "end": 109.92,
          "en": "So the next step now is to pre-populate this input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.92,
          "end": 112.59,
          "en": "with the current player name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.59,
          "end": 117.24000000000001,
          "en": "And for that, on this input which we are creating here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.24000000000001,
          "end": 119.72999999999999,
          "en": "we can set the value Prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.72999999999999,
          "end": 122.61,
          "en": "The value Prop allows us to, well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.61,
          "end": 126.633,
          "en": "set the value that's shown in this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.8,
          "end": 129.18,
          "en": "So therefore, here, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.18,
          "end": 132.42,
          "en": "we wanna set the value Prop to a dynamic value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.42,
          "end": 135.93,
          "en": "because the name that should be shown here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.93,
          "end": 140.37,
          "en": "is different for every instance of this player component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.37,
          "end": 142.89,
          "en": "It is one of those Props, after all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.89,
          "end": 144.96,
          "en": "So here we want to use that name Prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.96,
          "end": 148.323,
          "en": "to show that name as a value in that input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.49,
          "end": 153.03,
          "en": "And with that, if we save this, if I click edit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.03,
          "end": 156.24,
          "en": "you see now this is pre-populated with player",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.24,
          "end": 157.77,
          "en": "and we got some nice styling here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.77,
          "end": 160.683,
          "en": "due to that CSS file I provided to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.32999999999998,
          "end": 165.51,
          "en": "Now, of course, the last step for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.51,
          "end": 167.1,
          "en": "before we then make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.1,
          "end": 169.59,
          "en": "that we can actually change that name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.59,
          "end": 171.63,
          "en": "and such changes are picked up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.63,
          "end": 173.01,
          "en": "because at the moment you will see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.01,
          "end": 174.6,
          "en": "that you can't even change it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.6,
          "end": 176.28,
          "en": "But before we'll do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.28,
          "end": 178.65,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that clicking this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.65,
          "end": 181.8,
          "en": "when it says save, closes this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.8,
          "end": 183.33,
          "en": "or gets rid of the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.33,
          "end": 185.883,
          "en": "and goes back to just outputting the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.17,
          "end": 189.18,
          "en": "And for that, we, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.18,
          "end": 192.78,
          "en": "want to make this handleEditClick function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.78,
          "end": 195.03,
          "en": "a bit more flexible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.03,
          "end": 196.62,
          "en": "At the moment in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.62,
          "end": 200.82,
          "en": "we are always setting the isEditing state to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.82,
          "end": 204.66,
          "en": "And of course that's not entirely correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.66,
          "end": 208.98,
          "en": "Instead, we essentially wanna set the isEditing state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.98,
          "end": 212.37,
          "en": "to the opposite of what it currently is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.37,
          "end": 214.17000000000002,
          "en": "So if isEditing is true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.17000000000002,
          "end": 217.92000000000002,
          "en": "we wanna set it to false and vice versa.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 217.92000000000002,
          "end": 219.96,
          "en": "Now, we could achieve this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.96,
          "end": 223.86,
          "en": "by passing the following value to setIsEditing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.86,
          "end": 227.52,
          "en": "We could check isEditing with a ternary expression,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.52,
          "end": 230.28,
          "en": "and if it's truthy, if it's true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 230.28,
          "end": 234.36,
          "en": "we wanna pass false as a value to setIsEditing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.36,
          "end": 236.28300000000002,
          "en": "otherwise we want to pass true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.66,
          "end": 238.86,
          "en": "This would be one way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 238.86,
          "end": 242.73,
          "en": "of making sure that we switch the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.73,
          "end": 245.46,
          "en": "that is passed to setIsEditing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 245.46,
          "end": 248.1,
          "en": "And if you save this, you would indeed see that now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.1,
          "end": 252.603,
          "en": "we can open and close this input mode, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 253.56,
          "end": 257.7,
          "en": "But this solution here has a couple of flaws, actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 257.7,
          "end": 262.29,
          "en": "Now the first flaw is that it's unnecessarily complex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.29,
          "end": 265.8,
          "en": "because in JavaScript, if you have a Boolean value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.8,
          "end": 269.4,
          "en": "and you want to get the opposite of that value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.4,
          "end": 271.86,
          "en": "you can do that in a shorter way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.86,
          "end": 275.22,
          "en": "You can simply add an exclamation mark in front of it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 275.22,
          "end": 278.4,
          "en": "and this will basically invert the value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 278.4,
          "end": 283.02,
          "en": "So this will turn true to false and false to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 283.02,
          "end": 285.09000000000003,
          "en": "because we're getting the opposite of the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.09000000000003,
          "end": 286.98,
          "en": "we currently have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 286.98,
          "end": 291.15,
          "en": "So, that's better, and it would achieve the same result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 291.15,
          "end": 293.163,
          "en": "but it's still not perfect.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
